  atmosphericComposition: Approximately 96.5% carbon dioxide and 3.5% nitrogen with
    traces of sulfur dioxide water vapour and other gases. The planet is covered
    by thick sulfuric acid cloud layers.
  atmosphericPressureBar: 92
  minimumTemperatureC: 438
