  notableMoons: []
  internalStructure: ' Venus is believed to have an iron-rich core a rocky mantle
    and a silicate crust. Its internal structure is broadly similar in composition
    to Earth although important details remain uncertain.'
  surfaceAndRings: The surface contains volcanic plains mountains impact craters
    and extensive lava-related terrain. Venus has no planetary ring system
  magneticField: Venus does not possess an Earth-like intrinsic global magnetic field.
    Its interaction with the solar wind produces an induced magnetosphere.
